cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "CrooksJarzynskiLean: a Lean 4 formalization of the Crooks and Jarzynski fluctuation theorems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "kiyo-e"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kiyo-e/CrooksJarzynskiLean"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - stochastic thermodynamics
  - fluctuation theorems
  - Crooks theorem
  - Jarzynski equality
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked development of discrete-time stochastic thermodynamics in
  Lean 4. It proves finite-horizon Crooks and Jarzynski theorems for arbitrary
  measurable state spaces directly with Mathlib measures and Markov kernels,
  specializes them to Gibbs measures and standard physical work and
  free-energy weights, and provides real-integral, work-distribution,
  non-atomic Gaussian, and finite-state specializations. It also formalizes an
  explicit physical time-reversal protocol, compares discrete-time work
  conventions, and proves a path-uniform O(1/N) refinement bound. No sorry
  placeholders or custom axioms.
